        "en": "Peak-hour guard: warns before DeepSeek peak-priced hours, stops the sessions you pick when peak starts, resumes them when off-peak returns. Holiday and make-up-workday aware.",
        "zh-cn": "高峰计价前提醒、到点停掉你勾选的会话、低谷开始自动唤醒继续干活；内置节假日与调休日历，只作用于你勾选的会话。"
